{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-112258-r4523949","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Choco-Nutty Pie","sourcePageId":112258,"sourceRevision":"4523949","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-15T19:00:22Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Choco-Nutty%20Pie&oldid=4523949","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:38:11.334Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Inexpensive recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes for pies and tarts","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using chocolate","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Vegetarian recipes","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"8699ff517f3352e115d9d10ba61fa113ee11e4650dd71d5bdf498908e8b7b283","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Pie recipes|yield=1 pie|time=1 hour|difficulty=1}}\n{{recipe}}| [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|American cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Vegetarian cuisine|Vegetarian Cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Holiday Recipes|Holiday Recipes]] | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]]\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]], melted and cooled\n* 1 cup white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], [[Cookbook:Beat|beaten]] slightly\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 package (6 [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounces]]) [[Cookbook:Chocolate Chips|chocolate chips]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla]]\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Nut|nuts]] (your choice)\n* 1 unbaked [[Cookbook:Pie Crust|pastry pie shell]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Combine the first four ingredients and mix until well blended.\n# Stir in chocolate chips, vanilla, and nuts.\n# Pour into unbaked pie shell and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] at [[Cookbook:Oven temperatures|350°F]] for 45–50 minutes.\n# Let cool before cutting.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pies and tarts|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chocolate|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Choco-Nutty Pie","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"½ cup butter, melted and cooled","sourceText":"½ cup butter, melted and cooled","amountText":"½ cup butter, melted and cooled","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup white granulated sugar","sourceText":"1 cup white granulated sugar","amountText":"1 cup white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 eggs, beaten slightly","sourceText":"3 eggs, beaten slightly","amountText":"3 eggs, beaten slightly","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ cup flour","sourceText":"